  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated rural development project in Kyrgyz Republic</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhance social and economic empowerment of the vulnerable, Generate sustainable income, Strengthen implementation capacity for rural development1. &#xcde8;&#xc57d;&#xacc4;&#xce35; &#xc0ac;&#xd68c;&#xacbd;&#xc81c;&#xc801; &#xd658;&#xacbd; &#xac1c;&#xc120; &#xbc0f; &#xc5ed;&#xb7c9; &#xac15;&#xd654; 2. &#xc9c0;&#xc18d;&#xac00;&#xb2a5;&#xd55c; &#xc18c;&#xb4dd;&#xc99d;&#xb300; 3. &#xc815;&#xbd80; &#xb18d;&#xcd0c;&#xac1c;&#xbc1c; &#xc2e4;&#xd589;&#xc5ed;&#xb7c9; &#xac15;&#xd654;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improvement and operation of basic infrastructure through participatory approach, Creation of multipurpose village women&apos;s centers and operation of rural women&apos;s kitchen gardens, Providing capacity building programs to empower autonomous capacity and enhance awareness of gender equality, Supporting agricultural and livestock production in the income generation group, Supporting the distribution/sales of agricultural and livestock products in the income generation group, Improvement and digitization of the agricultural extension service delivery system, Providing education to strengthen rural development capabilities for public officials, Review and study of rural development policy</narrative>
  </description>
